  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H20v15H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 20.5v-15Z"/><path d="M8 8h8M8 11h6"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Quran Tajweed</h3>
          <p>All ages. Learn correct pronunciation and recitation rules through structured, one-on-one and small-group sessions.</p>
          <ul style="margin-top:1rem;">
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.5rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Beginner to advanced tracks</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Weekday &amp; weekend classes</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 3H20v15H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 4 20.5v-15Z"/><path d="M4 20.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 18H20"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Islamic Studies</h3>
          <p>All ages. Core subjects including Aqeedah, Fiqh and Seerah, taught with an emphasis on practical application.</p>
          <ul style="margin-top:1rem;">
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.5rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Structured curriculum by level</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Certificate on completion</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a14 14 0 0 1 0 18 14 14 0 0 1 0-18Z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Arabic Language</h3>
          <p>Beginners to advanced. Reading, writing, grammar and conversational Arabic taught in small classes.</p>
          <ul style="margin-top:1rem;">
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.5rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Focus on Qur'anic Arabic</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Conversation practice groups</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon"><svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M2.5 20c.8-3.6 3.3-5.6 6.5-5.6s5.7 2 6.5 5.6"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="9" r="2.4"/><path d="M15.5 14.5c2.6.2 4.5 2 5 5.5"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Hifdh Program</h3>
          <p>Memorisation Program. A dedicated, full-time track for students committed to memorising the Qur'an with strong revision support.</p>
          <ul style="margin-top:1rem;">
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:.5rem;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Daily revision &amp; testing</li>
            <li style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;"><span style="color:var(--green);"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"><path d="m5 12 5 5 9-11"/></svg></span> Limited intake, apply early</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
